          "snippet": {
            "line": 400,
            "text": "theorem nativeIndex_gap (h : ℝ) (hh : 0 ≤ h) {n m : ℕ}\n    (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hm : 1 ≤ m) (hnm : n ≤ m + 4) (hmn : m ≤ n + 4) :\n    nativeIndex h n ≤ nativeIndex h m + nativeGap h ∧\n      nativeIndex h m ≤ nativeIndex h n + nativeGap h"
